<title>UK: Chugai sets coupon on bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>Chugai sets coupon on bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The coupon on the following equity-linked issue has been fixed, lead manager Nomura International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHUGAI PHARMACEUTICAL CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     3.375     MATURITY    19.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 WARRANTS  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    19.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	PREMIUM    2.50 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) *5	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS TWO WARRANTS</p>
<p>		 EXERCISE PRICE WILL BE FIXED 10.SEP.96</p>
<p>		 EXERCISE PERIOD   - 03.OCT.96-05.SEP.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
